/a5ae1dee4032c074dbc81e7deae46f5a.mp4?t=1709309047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 20 levels (portal dungeons)<br></li><li> bosses<br></li><li> all items on levels can be magically destroyed (except architecture)<br></li><li> a variety of weapons and armor<br></li><li> daily challenges<br></li><li> bestiary<br></li><li> traps<br></li><li> co-op with a friend</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202140/extras/de19688722d1430bb884fc2c7ae094b6.poster.avif?t=1709309047\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202140/extras/de19688722d1430bb884fc2c7ae094b6.webm?t=1709309047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1202140/extras/de19688722d1430bb884fc2c7ae094b6.mp4?t=1709309047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
